# Generated Prisma client -- schema.prisma uses the default output location
# (node_modules/@prisma/client), never a custom one; this stale copy got
# accidentally committed early on and broke CI's Prettier check once it drifted
# out of sync with the schema (DEV_LOG 2026-08-16).
backend/database/prisma/generated/

